30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Most of our costs are fixed, like hall hire. Also, people are struggling to pay the full amount upfront.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,It seems charging per event kills the mood. People stop feeling like the club is their own space.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Takumi,,It's a joke. A tiny group does everything while others barely show up but pay the same.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The paperwork is a nightmare. Chasing small payments takes hours, and mid-year calculations are a mess.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Taster guests hate big upfront fees, but old records show that tiered grades caused a lot of friction.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing money is that hard, maybe we should simplify how we collect it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, I understand the frustration, but we shouldn't make the atmosphere feel like a transaction.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, it's already a transaction if the regulars are subsidizing the ghosts.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes. Any system that requires constant chasing is unsustainable for the treasurer.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, if people can't pay upfront, but tiers cause friction, what's left?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,We can't just guess the fee. We need a balance between stability and accessibility.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I'm worried that if we make it too rigid, the hesitant members will just stop coming.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I want a system where the people who actually use the club aren't the only ones paying.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need to minimize the administrative burden. Hand-calculating part-year fees is a waste of time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I just want newcomers to feel welcome without feeling judged by their ""grade"" or ""level.""","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Mio,,"It sounds like we all want something different, but we agree the current way is broken.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I just want the peace of the club preserved.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Takumi,,Fairness is more important than a vague feeling of peace.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Efficiency is the only way the club survives its administration.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's see the options and find a middle ground.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
