55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is a flat fee, B is tiered, and C is activity-based. A seems the most stable for the budget.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C is out for me. I've seen how door charges drive people away from weekday meetings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option B would solve the fairness issue, but @Kenji mentioned it caused friction in the past.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C is a treasurer's nightmare. Option A is the most efficient for the books.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I dislike B because of the social divide. A is too steep for newcomers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, if A is too steep, maybe we can offer payment plans? The bank statements showed people want that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"A flat fee makes the club feel like a home again, rather than a series of purchases.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we go with A, the ghosts still get a free ride on the regulars' hard work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the alternative is spending six hours a month chasing pennies. That's not a fair trade.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"If we can't do B or C, A is the only one that keeps the membership invisible.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm leaning towards A. It covers the fixed costs and is the easiest to predict.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for A. It removes the hesitation at the door.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I still hate the unfairness, but I can't support a system that kills attendance or kills the treasurer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Toshio,,A is the only logical choice for the administration.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll go with A if we make sure it doesn't scare off the taster guests.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,It seems we are in agreement then.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Takumi,,Fine.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
